.TH SPP-MAKE-FORM 1 "October 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
spp-make-form \- Scaffold zero-code declarative YAML form definition or fluent PHP form class
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php make:form
.I <name>
[\fB\-\-app\fR=\fIappname\fR]
[\fB\-\-yaml\fR]
[\fB\-\-php\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new SPP form definition. By default or with \fB\-\-yaml\fR, provisions a zero-code declarative YAML form in \fBetc/apps/<appname>/forms/<name>.yml\fR.
With \fB\-\-php\fR, provisions a programmatic PHP builder class.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I <name>
Form identifier name.
.TP
\fB\-\-app\fR=\fIappname\fR
Application context name.
.TP
\fB\-\-yaml\fR
Generate zero-code declarative YAML form definition (default).
.TP
\fB\-\-php\fR
Generate programmatic PHP builder class.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Resolves target directory in app context, scaffolds form schema/class with validations, and updates \fB__spp_file_props.yml\fR.
